      "value": "Not sure how well this comes across in the video, but here's a couple of examples of the camera spawning way too close: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pj8mkubyCUU\nIn the first case it requires me to pull my hand back quite a bit to pick up the camera; in the second case it spawns basically right in front of my face.",
