      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c1475afb7ce126e9e0e3a39|full_name}: Hmm... The camera used to spawn at the location of the big menu. (Not the quick menu)\nI changed it so that it spawns near the hand that clicked the button to spawn the camera.\nIt's also based on the orientation of your hand (it's similar to how the Quick Menu is placed).\nI think what's happening here is that you're rotating your hand back, and its being pushed into your face since it spawns up and to the left of your hand.\nIf you have any suggestions on what you think might be a better method to place it when it spawn, I'm all ears, but it needs to work for smaller avatars as well (this is why it was changed)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
